WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.531
For forty years, I kept this light.

2
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.148
Three flashes, every fifteen seconds. Its
name, written on the dark.

3
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.822
Most nights, no one was out there. You light
it anyway.

4
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.869
Tonight, someone was.

5
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.884
Then the lamp went out.

6
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.715
All I had left was one small flame. And the
glass.

7
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.065
Glass doesn't make light. It makes it reach.

8
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.600
And out of the dark, three flashes came
back.

9
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.988
Somewhere tonight, someone is keeping a
light for you.
